**Option 1: Clean & Modern (Good for most websites)**

```css
.header {
  background-color: #f8f8f8; /* Light gray background */
  padding: 20px;
  border-bottom: 3px solid #333; /* Dark gray border at the bottom */
  box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); /* Subtle shadow */
  text-align: center; /* Center the content (can be changed) */
  font-family: sans-serif; /* Use a clean font */
  color: #333; /* Dark gray text */
}

.header h1 {
  margin: 0; /* Remove default heading margin */
  font-size: 2em; /* Make the heading larger */
}
```

**Explanation:**

*   **`background-color: #f8f8f8;`**:  A light gray background makes it stand out without being too harsh.  You can change this to any color you like.
