*   **`font-family: sans-serif;`**:  Uses a standard sans-serif font for readability.  Replace with your preferred font.
*   **`color: #333;`**:  Dark gray text provides good contrast against the light background.
*   **`.header h1 { ... }`**:  Styles the `<h1>` element within the header (usually the main title).  `margin: 0;` removes the default margin that browsers apply to headings.  `font-size: 2em;` makes the heading larger.

